  "body": "Follow-up of #4338 (U12 of #3663, the Holders page).\n\n## What happens\n\nThe Holders page has the buttons **Import…** and **Export…** in its header row. The buttons are disabled. Their hover text names this issue.\n\n## Expected\n\n- **Export…** writes the user holders of the document to a holder file. The file uses the component library format (`component_library::to_text`).\n- **Import…** reads such a file. It adds each holder as a user holder of the document, in one undo step. A name that the document has already gets a new `user:` id, as \"Copy as user holder\" does.\n- A file that is not correct is refused by name. The document does not change.\n\n## Done means\n\n- Tests for an export and an import round trip, for one undo step, and for a refused file.\n- The buttons are enabled, with a hover text that says what they do.\n",
